from pathlib import Path
import json,shutil
p=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]; idle=p.parent/'overall-hero-west-idle-v1'
analysis={
'SW':['63: left-screen boot extended down-left heel contact, other boot behind/right; near visible arm low/back','64: forward boot carries weight, trailing boot draws inward raised; arms begin crossing neutral','65: feet nearly cross under hips, body higher, forward swing arm reaches ahead','66: opposite leg now forward down-left, other knee flexed behind; arms reverse first contact','67: opposite support at lowest down-left boot, far leg drawing through; near arm forward','68: feet return toward passing, one boot lifts; near arm returns back preparing 63'],
'W':['69: long split stride toward left, front toe/heel extended left and trailing boot right, near arm forward','70: leftward support flat, trailing boot lifts inward, near arm descends','71: narrow passing stride with knee rising, feet overlap in depth, near arm behind hip','72: opposite long contact, forward boot left and trailing heel raised right; near arm backward','73: opposite support and recoil, trailing boot draws through, near arm begins forward','74: second narrow passing with opposite knee, forward arm returning toward frame69'],
'NW':['75: away-left diagonal, near lower-right boot supporting, other boot lifted up-left; near arm forward-left','76: support rolls forward, lifted boot passing, arms approaching center','77: feet narrow beneath torso, opposite leg prepares away-left contact, near arm back','78: opposite long diagonal split, forward boot left and trailing boot down-right, opposite arms','79: support progresses, trailing foot draws toward body, near arm returns','80: second narrow passing, near boot low and other farther up; arms close cycle']}
(p/'POSE_ANALYSIS.md').write_text('# Source walk phase analysis\n\nSource artwork is pose authority, generated idle is identity only. Screen-side descriptions avoid assuming anatomical left/right hidden by occlusion. Original checker shadow is retained in source and is not a boot landmark. All six frames examined before generation.\n\n'+'\n\n'.join('## '+d+'\n'+'\n'.join('- '+r for r in rows) for d,rows in analysis.items())+'\n\nSix phases form two opposing half cycles, not repeated identical legs; the source shows grounded walking without a running flight phase. Native offsets, bob and arm swing must remain. Exact anatomical contacts remain visual-review items at source resolution.\n')
for d in analysis:
 shutil.copy2(idle/f'raw/{d}-raw.png',p/f'inputs/{d}-idle-identity.png')
 prompt=f'''Use case: identity-preserve. Create an authentic pure 2D painted game sprite WALK animation sheet, transparent RGBA. Exactly 6 complete separate full-body figures in a precise 3 columns x 2 rows equal-cell grid, row-major phase0 to phase5. No text, borders, labels, shadows or floor. Direction {d}, same fixed elevated isometric camera in all six cells.
Image 1 is ORIGINAL SIX-PHASE WALK POSE AUTHORITY. Copy its six corresponding body poses, head inclination, foot positions, modest vertical bob, stride length and opposing arm swing in exact order, one for one. Ignore its white clothes and brown hair; DO NOT copy its checker shadow. Image 2 is NEW {d} IDLE IDENTITY REFERENCE ONLY; use this same young adult male face, black parted short hair, black charcoal tactical suit, steel-gray segmented plates, dark red shoulder plates, gloves and sturdy boots, same adult proportions. Image 3 is additional established identity reference. Do NOT copy idle poses. Render newly drawn walk figures in this identity; no mirror flips, no 3D, no Blender, no skeleton renders, no extra gear or weapons.
Pose sequence: {'; '.join(analysis[d])}.
The first three poses and last three poses must alternate which leg leads and counter-swing arms. WALK, not run: upright modest torso lean, grounded gait, no sprint or both-feet-flight. Preserve original relative motion and elevation across cells; never normalize every foot to the same baseline. Keep uniform character scale across all six, each comfortably inside its cell with equal broad margins. Full head and both boots visible, two arms and two legs, no duplicated limbs, no merged legs. Clean detailed hand-painted 2D RPG sprite edges and readable black/gray material, consistent restrained light. Exactly six frames, three above three below, no seventh image.'''
 args={'prompt':prompt,'referenced_image_paths':[str(p/f'inputs/{d}-original-sixphase-3x2.png'),str(p/f'inputs/{d}-idle-identity.png'),str(p/'inputs/SE-HD-identity-phase0.png')],'transparent_background':True}
 (p/f'provenance/{d}-actualargs.json').write_text(json.dumps(args,indent=2))
